  <data name="AboutMediaCenterContent" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Under the supervision of the General Directorate of Media, Communication and Knowledge Impact, the Media Center aims to bridge the communication gap between the university and its target audience, serving as the university's window to the community. The center engages the target audience in interacting with its communication messages using best practices, theories, and creative solutions to shape a future through knowledge impact. In addition, it plays a part in solidifying the university's position in spreading knowledge in the current creative economy era, striving to achieve a sustainable and impactful presence in the media sphere.</value>
