  <data name="LifeHereContent" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Life at Princess Nourah University is the story of the world’s largest women’s university, a place where tradition meets innovation, and where every detail is designed with students in mind. Our campus combines originality and modernity, offering state-of-the-art facilities, unique architecture, and services that ensure comfort and convenience for all.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="LifeHereContent1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>At PNU, students are given the space and support to grow, develop their skills, and discover their full potential. We foster an environment that inspires intellectual curiosity, encourages personal growth, and provides a truly holistic educational experience.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="LifeHereContent2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>To be at PNU is to belong to a vibrant community that celebrates excellence, embraces the future, and connects you to the world.</value>
  </data>
